chromium-seccomp.json is the Playwright Chromium sandbox seccomp profile from:
https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/v1.64.1/utils/docker/seccomp_profile.json

Playwright is Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The profile is used with the non-root pwuser and Chromium's sandbox enabled.
It is not permission to run the renderer with privileged host access.
